# Real invoices for the M5 eval set — personal financial documents, never committed.
# Their expected-output fixtures under apps/ai/evals/fixtures/real/ reference these by path and
# are committed normally; only the source documents themselves stay local.
#
# Anchored to the repository root deliberately. Written as a bare `invoices/` it matched at any
# depth, which also swallowed scripts/demo_seed/pdfs/invoices/ — the *synthetic* invoices the
# demo profile seeds from. Those are generated, contain no real financial data, and must ship,
# or the demo org cannot be seeded on any machine that did not generate them locally.
/invoices/
